<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<title>RYZO AI</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">

  <!-- ======= LOGIN VIEW ======= -->
  <div id="loginView">
    <div id="loginBg"></div>
    <div id="loginVeil"></div>
    <div class="login-box">
      <div class="login-mark"></div>
      <h1 class="login-title">RYZO AI</h1>
      <p class="login-sub">Masuk dulu buat lanjut</p>

      <form id="loginForm">
        <input type="text" id="loginUser" placeholder="Username" autocomplete="username" required>
        <input type="password" id="loginPass" placeholder="Password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
        <div class="login-error" id="loginError"></div>
        <button type="submit" id="loginBtn">Masuk</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ======= HUB VIEW ======= -->
  <div id="hubView">
    <div class="hero">
      <img src="assets/eye.jpg" alt="RYZO AI">
      <div class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span><span>RYZO AI</span></div>
      <div class="hero-tag">by Roy</div>
    </div>

    <div class="body-wrap">

      <div class="status-card">
        <div class="avatar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.5-6 8-6s8 2 8 6" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="status-grid">
          <div class="row">Negara <b>Indonesia</b></div>
          <div class="row">Device <b>Android</b></div>
          <div class="row">Browser <b>Chrome</b></div>
          <div class="row status-online"><i></i><b>Online</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tabs">
        <div class="tab active">Semua</div>
        <div class="tab">Downloader</div>
        <div class="tab">Maker</div>
        <div class="tab">Tools</div>
        <div class="tab" onclick="openChat()">Chat AI</div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-title">Semua Tools</div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Instagram</h3>
          <p>Download video &amp; foto tanpa aplikasi tambahan</p>
          <span class="badge">HD</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M16 8v8a4 4 0 1 1-4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 8c1.5 1.3 3 1.8 4.5 1.8V6.3C18.8 6.1 17.3 5 16 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>TikTok</h3>
          <p>Simpan video tanpa watermark, cepat &amp; ringan</p>
          <span class="badge">MP4</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="2.5" y="5.5" width="19" height="13" rx="3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M10 9l5 3-5 3V9z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
          <h3>YouTube</h3>
          <p>Ambil video atau audio dalam berbagai kualitas</p>
          <span class="badge">MP4/MP3</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3 15l5-4 4 3 5-5 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Poster Generator</h3>
          <p>Buat gambar kutipan dari teks kamu sendiri</p>
          <span class="badge">BARU</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4h16v12H7l-3 3V4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Quote Generator</h3>
          <p>Bikin kutipan estetik ala tampilan populer</p>
          <span class="badge">GRATIS</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3l2.5 5.5L20 9l-4 4 1 6-5-3-5 3 1-6-4-4 5.5-.5L12 3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Tanya Siapa Saja</h3>
          <p>Meme generator jawaban singkat &amp; nyeleneh</p>
          <span class="badge">FUN</span>
          <div class="go"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-cta" onclick="openChat()">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4h16v12H8l-4 4V4z" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h4>Chat sama RYZO AI</h4>
          <p>Tanya apa aja, jawabannya lengkap &amp; gacor</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-note">RYZO AI dibuat oleh Roy ✦</div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ======= CHAT VIEW ======= -->
  <div id="chatView">
    <div id="chatBg"></div>
    <div id="chatVeil"></div>
    <div class="chat-inner">
      <div class="chat-header">
        <div class="back-btn" onclick="closeChat()">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-mark"></div>
        <div class="chat-title">
          <b>RYZO AI</b>
          <span>gacor, siap bantu apa aja</span>
        </div>
        <div class="new-chat-btn" onclick="newChat()" title="Chat baru">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="new-chat-btn" onclick="logout()" title="Keluar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4M16 17l5-5-5-5M21 12H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="log">
        <div class="hint" id="hint">
          <b>RYZO AI</b><br>
          Halo! Aku RYZO AI ⚡ — bisa bantu jawab pertanyaan, jelasin sesuatu sampai detail, bikinin kode program, kasih saran, atau sekadar nemenin ngobrol.
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="form">
        <textarea id="txt" rows="1" placeholder="Tulis pesan ke RYZO AI..." autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        <button id="send" type="submit" aria-label="Kirim">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12L20 4L14 20L11 13L4 12Z" fill="white"/></svg>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
                                </html>
